15:T4c4,B34R CL4N isn't just a name—it's a movement. Built on teamwork dedication and pure love for the game B34R CL4N has grown into a respected force within the Call of Duty: Mobile community. Known for their tactical plays fierce competitive spirit and an unshakable bond the clan embodies what it means to dominate the battlefield while still upholding the values of respect and sportsmanship.

The battleground is heating up and the competition is fiercer than ever. KUER Call of Duty Tournaments have quickly become one of the most exciting esports events in the region bringing together top talent rising stars and passionate fans of Call of Duty: Mobile. And now we're proud to announce a powerful partnership that's taking things to the next level.

Why KUER Tournaments?

Sponsoring the KUER Call of Duty Tournaments is more than just a partnership—it's a mission. B34R CL4N is committed to growing the local and regional esports scene giving players a platform to showcase their skills and providing fans with unforgettable competitive moments.

